OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fresh but largely dry and
OL,6,Fbright start to the day. Cloud will
OL,7,Fincrease, bringing showers later, some
OL,8,Fheavy and perhaps thundery. Feeling
OL,9,Fcooler with temperatures near average.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers will ease this
OL,12,Fevening, though some may linger in the
OL,13,Fnorthwest into the early hours.
OL,14,FClearer skies will bring a chilly
OL,15,Fnight, especially in rural areas.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA dry, bright day with sunny
OL,18,Fspells and patches of fair weather
OL,19,Fcloud. After a cool start,
OL,20,Ftemperatures will rise to around
OL,21,Faverage in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
